    "text": "The following are the Vander Waal's parameters for four gases W, X, Y and Z<br />\r&nbsp;\r<table border=\"1\">\r\t<tbody>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>Gas</td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>W</td>\r\t\t\t<td>4.0</td>\r\t\t\t<td>0.027</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>X</td>\r\t\t\t<td>8.0</td>\r\t\t\t<td>0.030</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>Y</td>\r\t\t\t<td>6.0</td>\r\t\t\t<td>0.032</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>Z</td>\r\t\t\t<td>12.0</td>\r\t\t\t<td>0.027</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</tbody>\r</table>\r<br />\r<br />\rBased on given values identify, which one of these gases has the highest critical temperature"
